## 🧼 `.gitignore`

```gitignore
# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.pyo
*.pyd
*.pkl

# Virtual environments
env/
venv/
.venv/

# Jupyter
.ipynb_checkpoints/

# VS Code
.vscode/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Logs and data
*.log
*.csv
*.tmp

# Gradio cache
gradio_cached_examples/

# Model files
*.joblib
*.sav
*.h5

# System
Thumbs.db
